# App Design

The application uses a simple interface designed around viewing and managing saved notes.

## Main Screen

The main activity displays saved notes using a `RecyclerView`.

A floating action button allows the user to create a new note. A search function is also available to filter notes by their title or content.

## Note Screen

The note screen is used when creating or editing a note.

Users can enter a title and note content before saving it.

## User Interaction

The application supports actions such as:

- Creating a note
- Opening a note for editing
- Searching notes
- Pinning and unpinning notes
- Deleting notes

The design focuses on keeping the main note-management actions accessible without making the interface unnecessarily complicated.
